# Time-boxed exception for the pinned ClamAV sidecar image ONLY (ci.yml job
# `clamav-signatures`, ADR-049 § "Temporary exception"). Never used by the
# Rasta service image scans.
#
# CVE-2026-103111 — pcre2 out-of-bounds write via a crafted regular
# expression. Fixed in pcre2 10.49-r0, which Alpine 3.24 already ships, but the
# newest upstream clamav/clamav image (1.5.4, 2026-10-01) still carries
# 10.48-r0. In clamd, regular expressions come from the signature databases,
# not from scanned content, so exploiting it needs control of the signatures
# (signed CVDs) — not of an uploaded document.
# The three other pcre2 HIGHs (fixed in 10.48-r0) are closed by the digest bump.
# Expires on its own: on 2026-10-16 the scan fails again unless upstream has
# shipped a fixed image (bump the digest) or the exception is re-reviewed.
CVE-2026-103111 exp:2026-10-16
